<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: field air-defence system -->
  <DMSE_Building_FieldAirDefense.label>野戰防空砲</DMSE_Building_FieldAirDefense.label>
  <!-- EN: A self-contained air-defense turret with twin autocannons, four short-range missiles and its own search and tracking radar. It engages targets with missiles first, then finishes them off with its guns.\n\nFully automatic. The cannons also fire on ground enemies and use steel as ammunition. The radar uses a lot of power, and its emissions can be tracked by anti-radiation missiles. -->
  <DMSE_Building_FieldAirDefense.description>一座自成一體的防空砲塔，配有雙聯機砲、四枚短程導彈與自己的搜索追蹤雷達。先以導彈接戰，再用機砲收拾殘餘目標。\n\n全自動運作。機砲也會攻擊地面敵人，並以鋼材作為彈藥。雷達耗電量大，發出的電波會被反輻射導彈追蹤。</DMSE_Building_FieldAirDefense.description>
  <!-- EN: Cannon rounds -->
  <DMSE_Building_FieldAirDefense.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>機砲彈</DMSE_Building_FieldAirDefense.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
  <!-- EN: Cannon rounds -->
  <DMSE_Building_FieldAirDefense.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>機砲彈</DMSE_Building_FieldAirDefense.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>
  <!-- EN: Cannot fire the cannon: no rounds. -->
  <DMSE_Building_FieldAirDefense.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>機砲無法開火：沒有彈藥。</DMSE_Building_FieldAirDefense.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>
  
  <!-- EN: vertical launch silo -->
  <DMSE_Building_MediumVLS.label>垂直發射井</DMSE_Building_MediumVLS.label>
  <!-- EN: A vertical launcher with four cells for medium missiles. Each missile is pushed out of its tube before igniting, and a built-in flame trench allows repeated launches. It is costly to build.\n\nCannot be built on a gravship. -->
  <DMSE_Building_MediumVLS.description>一座有四個中型導彈發射格的垂直發射器。導彈會先被推出發射管再點火，內建的導焰槽可承受反覆發射。建造成本高。\n\n無法建造在重力船上。</DMSE_Building_MediumVLS.description>
  
  <!-- EN: rotary launch rail -->
  <DMSE_Building_RotaryLauncher.label>旋轉發射架</DMSE_Building_RotaryLauncher.label>
  <!-- EN: An old launch rail that turns a full circle by hand crank. It fires early loitering munitions and light missiles, and reloads one round at a time.\n\nNeeds no power, but requires an operator at all times. -->
  <DMSE_Building_RotaryLauncher.description>一座以手搖曲柄旋轉、可轉向全方位的老式發射軌。能發射早期巡飛彈與輕型導彈，一次只能裝填一枚。\n\n不需要電力，但必須隨時有人操作。</DMSE_Building_RotaryLauncher.description>
  
  <!-- EN: 30 mm round -->
  <DMSE_Bullet_FieldAirDefense.label>30 毫米砲彈</DMSE_Bullet_FieldAirDefense.label>
  
  <!-- EN: fire control radar -->
  <DMSE_FireControlRadar.label>火控雷達</DMSE_FireControlRadar.label>
  <!-- EN: A dedicated fire-control radar. It turns search radar tracks into firing solutions and guides several interceptors at once, much faster and more accurately than early sets.\n\nNeeds a steady power supply. Its emissions can be tracked by anti-radiation missiles. -->
  <DMSE_FireControlRadar.description>一座專用火控雷達。能把搜索雷達的航跡轉成射擊諸元，同時導引數枚攔截彈，速度與精度都遠勝早期型號。\n\n需要穩定供電。它發出的電波會被反輻射導彈追蹤。</DMSE_FireControlRadar.description>
  
  <!-- EN: twin 30 mm cannon -->
  <DMSE_Gun_FieldAirDefense.label>雙聯 30 毫米機砲</DMSE_Gun_FieldAirDefense.label>
  <!-- EN: A pair of 30 mm automatic cannon mounted beside the missile tubes of a field air-defence system. -->
  <DMSE_Gun_FieldAirDefense.description>一對裝在野戰防空系統導彈發射筒旁的 30 毫米自動機砲。</DMSE_Gun_FieldAirDefense.description>
  <!-- EN: twin 30 mm cannon -->
  <DMSE_Gun_FieldAirDefense.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>TODO</DMSE_Gun_FieldAirDefense.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
  <!-- EN: search radar -->
  <DMSE_SearchRadar.label>搜索雷達</DMSE_SearchRadar.label>
  <!-- EN: An active search radar with a rotating antenna. It finds and tracks incoming threats for the whole air-defense network, but cannot guide interceptors by itself.\n\nUses a lot of power. Its emissions can be tracked by anti-radiation missiles. -->
  <DMSE_SearchRadar.description>一座天線旋轉掃描的主動搜索雷達。能為整個防空網發現並追蹤來襲目標，但本身無法導引攔截彈。\n\n耗電量大。它發出的電波會被反輻射導彈追蹤。</DMSE_SearchRadar.description>
  
</LanguageData>